{"text": "I'll explore a different angle from the obvious multiplication paths.", "start": 0, "end": 69, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Let me try combining division and subtraction creatively.", "start": 70, "end": 127, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "What if we use (8 - (7 / 7)) * 4?", "start": 128, "end": 161, "label": "setQuestion"}
